M1 stamp 调用整个撤掉（回到「只能手工盖章」的病根形态）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
provenance.stamp(
        a.out, GENERATOR, root=ROOT, expect_bytes=expect_bytes,
        extra={
            "source_parquet": str(a.verification),
            "source_parquet_sha256": _sha256_of(a.verification),
            "verdicts_measured": res["verdicts"],
            "trading_days_measured": res["trading_days"],
        })
=== 变异体 ===
    _dropped = {
        "source_parquet": str(a.verification),
        "source_parquet_sha256": _sha256_of(a.verification),
    }

M2 generator 常量指向别的脚本（章上的 generator 字段说谎）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
GENERATOR = "scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py"
=== 变异体 ===
GENERATOR = "scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py.bak"

M3 章里写死一个 sha256 字面量（与底稿实际字节永远无关）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
            "source_parquet_sha256": _sha256_of(a.verification),
=== 变异体 ===
            "source_parquet_sha256": "827c48f739e14f7495fcc5b0102cec44a65e633b1c3f3ef87bd16c5c35a84ae4",

M4 把路径字符串放进叫 sha256 的字段（产物层守卫对它零覆盖）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
            "source_parquet_sha256": _sha256_of(a.verification),
=== 变异体 ===
            "source_parquet_sha256": str(a.verification),

M5 指纹原语退回 mtime 代理（改了又改回骗得过）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
    return hashlib.sha256(path.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
=== 变异体 ===
    return hashlib.sha256(str(path.stat().st_mtime).encode()).hexdigest()

M6 --out 默认回到 None（裸跑只打印不落盘，而闸门看起来成功）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
ap.add_argument("--out", type=Path,
                    default=ROOT / "data/reports/hit_rate_diagnosis.json")
=== 变异体 ===
    ap.add_argument("--out", type=Path, default=None)

M7 把抓取点赋值成 None（关键字仍在，字节检查被 stamp() 整项跳过）	scripts/diagnose_hit_rate.py
    expect_bytes = provenance.code_file_sha256(ROOT, GENERATOR)
=== 变异体 ===
    expect_bytes = None
